# ==========================================
# Compiled Rust Artifacts (Per-App)
# ==========================================
# Matches 'target' folder at any depth
**/target/

# Backup files generated by cargo fix
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo lockfiles for local learning experiments
**/Cargo.lock

# ==========================================
# Devin Desktop / VS Code Core Configuration
# ==========================================
# Ignores workspace-specific settings at any depth
**/.vscode/

# Proactively catches agentic workspace state logs
**/.devin/

# Local logs generated by applications or the editor
**/*.log

# ==========================================
# Operating System Metadata
# ==========================================
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
